---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About Us">
  <section class="page-hero"><img src="/images/team-mono.jpg" alt="Players in their academy kit" width="2841" height="3552" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="page-overlay"></div><div class="container page-title"><p class="eyebrow">About Eruditeballersafrica</p><h1>Football is<br/>the starting point.</h1><p>We’re here to help young people grow as players, learners, teammates, and people.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container story"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p><h2>Scholars<br/>are ballers.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">We see football as a powerful way to build discipline, belonging, and opportunity.</p><p>Eruditeballersafrica Football Academy brings the game together with a commitment to academic preparation. Our work is grounded in the belief that every player deserves thoughtful coaching, encouragement, and room to define their own future.</p><p>We aim to create an environment where effort matters, teammates support one another, and families have a clear conversation about each player’s pathway.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="community"><img src="/images/team-squad.jpg" alt="Academy squad together" width="3888" height="2592" loading="lazy"/><div class="community-caption"><span class="eyebrow">The people make the academy</span><h2>Better together.</h2></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">What guides us</p><div class="values"><article><span>01</span><h3>Learning</h3><p>Progress comes from practice, reflection, and being willing to learn.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Respect</h3><p>We value people, the game, and the responsibility that comes with being part of a team.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Possibility</h3><p>We help players see a future with more than one path forward.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <style>.page-hero{min-height:580px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.page-hero>img,.page-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.page-hero>img{object-position:center 38%}.page-overlay{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#091a37ed,#091a3780 55%,#091a3720)}.page-title{position:relative;padding:5rem 0}.page-title .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.page-title h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,7rem)}.page-title>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:32rem;color:#e2e9f2}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:5rem}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)}.community{height:560px;position:relative;background:var(--navy)}.community img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 35%;opacity:.76}.community-caption{position:absolute;left:max(calc((100% - 1180px)/2),1.5rem);bottom:3rem;color:#fff}.community-caption .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.community-caption h2{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6.5rem);margin:0}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.values article{border-top:1px solid #ffffff45;padding-top:1.2rem}.values article span{color:var(--gold);font:700 1.1rem var(--display)}.values h3{margin-top:1rem}.values p{color:#c1cddd}@media(max-width:700px){.story,.values{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.community{height:400px}.community-caption{left:1rem;bottom:2rem}}</style>
</SiteLayout>
